WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.800
REHLA: a destination-led introduction to Jordan.

00:05.800 --> 00:11.000
Explore destinations, places to stay, and dining.

00:11.000 --> 00:16.400
Browse the real tourism catalog and open a place.

00:16.400 --> 00:20.100
Discover hotels using stored tourism information.

00:20.100 --> 00:23.400
Explore restaurants before building an itinerary.

00:23.400 --> 00:30.700
Open a saved plan generated by the real AI service.

00:30.700 --> 00:35.000
Confirm the plan, then activate an operational trip.

00:35.000 --> 00:39.400
Follow the itinerary, map, and trip progress.

00:39.400 --> 00:46.700
Open a place guide with historical and cultural context.

00:46.700 --> 00:50.600
Ask the trip-scoped Smart Guide about the next activity.

00:50.600 --> 00:56.050
Read the actual live-provider reply grounded in trip context.
